# Must point at your actual live Render backend URL, including /api.
# There is no hardcoded fallback anymore - if this is missing, the app
# will visibly show a "server not configured" banner instead of quietly
# calling the wrong host.
#
# IMPORTANT: Render assigns your service's real public hostname when you
# first create it. If the name in backend/.render.yaml (sonara-backend)
# was already taken, Render silently appends a random suffix - so your
# real URL might be something like https://sonara-backend-a1b2.onrender.com
# and NOT simply https://sonara-backend.onrender.com. Always copy the
# exact URL from the Render dashboard, don't assume it from the service
# name.
VITE_API_URL=https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-RENDER-URL.onrender.com/api
